.TH DANBY-DRYPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-drypendulum \- pendulum with Coulomb dry friction
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/drypendulum
.SH MODEL
A fixed-magnitude torque opposes the direction of motion. Unlike linear
damping, successive amplitudes fall approximately linearly before stopping.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/drypendulum.b
